<vertex eid="3"><attributes><attribute class="java.lang.String" key="type">entity</attribute><attribute class="com.flyinglogic.logicgraph.entityclass.EntityClass" key="entityClass"><entityClass name="Answered No" uuid="fa010909-0000-4000-8000-000000000003"/></attribute><attribute class="java.lang.String" key="title">P01 [NO]
40-cell stage completes construction?</attribute><attribute class="java.lang.String" key="note">P01 | 40-cell stage completes construction?

Status: NO

Method: Functional isolation / build before run

Scope / coordinates: SP8 40-cell prefix, merged tree 0488c84; --include-isolated --cells 40 --control ei; build-only.

Remaining search space: Actual construction succeeds for every selected cell, or at least one import/build fails.

Binary predicate: The build completes all selected morphologies and discretization without error.

Decision limit: Successful real construction of all 40 selected cells, not an extrapolated cost estimate.

Recorded observation: Build fails at 82.6 s, before discretization, in H01Archive.load for cell 5805562981: from_points requires at least two points.

YES: Proceed to separately measured initialization and runtime.

NO: Localize the import failure before investigating network stepping.

Next check: Use P02 to retain the recorded import-level localization.

Unresolved after either answer: Subsequent init/run stages were not launched; no 40-cell runtime measurement exists.

Evidence (repository-relative):
docs/evidence/h01-population-build-40.json
docs/evidence/h01-population-build-40.md

